#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_nol
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Thanks to the Christmas Gift Fund, we can offer a Christmas gift to each\n"
"                child registered in a Compassion center. It prevents inequalities\n"
"                between the children at least at this special time of the year. We are\n"
"                very grateful for your donation by which you share the joy of Christmas\n"
"                with each child of Compassion.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to the Christmas Gift Fund, we can offer a Christmas gift to \n"
"ttteach child registered in a Compassion center. It prevents inequalities between the children \n"
"tttat least at this special time of the year.\n"
"tttWe are very grateful for your donation by which you share the joy of Christmas with each \n"
"tttchild of Compassion."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_wtp
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water disinfection\n"
"                project to provide sponsored children, their families, their community\n"
"                and villages with drinking water, in the poorest regions of the world.\n"
"                This help would not be possible without you and we are very grateful for\n"
"                your support.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water disinfection\n"
"            project to provide sponsored children, their families, their community and villages with\n"
"            drinking water, in the poorest regions of the world.\n"
"            This help would not be possible without you and we are very grateful for your support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_csp
msgid ""
"\n"
"                The CSP Fund  (Child Survival Program) allows us to support 3 CSP\n"
"                centers, two in Haiti and one in Ecuador. Each CSP center welcomes\n"
"                around 30 mothers and their babies and pregnant women. These women\n"
"                receive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on\n"
"                a regular basis and Bible lessons.\n"
"\n"
"                We are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their\n"
"                babies and for the hope you are bringing to them through your help.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"The CSP Fund  (Child Survival Program) allows us to support 3 CSP centers,\n"
"            two in Haiti and one in Ecuador. Each CSP center welcomes around 30 mothers and their babies and\n"
"            pregnant women. These women receive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks\n"
"            on a regular basis and Bible lessons.\n"
"\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their babies and for the hope you\n"
"            are bringing to them through your help."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_usp
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your donation to the \"Unsponsored Children Fund\" unlocks the benefits\n"
"                of Compassion's program for children who have been registered but not\n"
"                yet been sponsored. Your gift to this fund also encourages parents and\n"
"                program staff as they see Compassion benefits at work for the children\n"
"                they love, even as they wait — and hope — for sponsors.\n"
"\n"
"                We thank you very much for your precious support.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Your donation to the \"Unsponsored Children Fund\" unlocks the benefits \n"
"tttof Compassion's program for children who have been registered but not yet been sponsored. Your \n"
"tttgift to this fund also encourages parents and program staff as they see Compassion benefits at \n"
"tttwork for the children they love, even as they wait — and hope — for sponsors.\n"
"\n"
"tttWe thank you very much for your precious support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ovc
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Compassion's Highly Vulnerable Children's Fund provides food,\n"
"            clothing and a nurturing Christian home environment to children in poverty who are orphans\n"
"            or who have no adult caretakers.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Compassion's Highly Vulnerable Children's Fund provides food,\n"
"            clothing and a nurturing Christian home environment to children in poverty who are orphans\n"
"            or who have no adult caretakers."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_mds
msgid ""
"\n"
"            On behalf of of Raymond Girardet, we thank you for your donation\n"
"            which will allow him to realize his project.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_aid
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to the AIDS fund we can bring the necessary lifelong care to\n"
"            the HIV-infected sponsored children (antiretroviral therapy).\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your support to this fund and\n"
"            for the great hope you offer to the sick children and their families.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to the AIDS fund we can bring the necessary lifelong care to\n"
"            the HIV-infected sponsored children (antiretroviral therapy).\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your support to this fund and\n"
"            for the great hope you offer to the sick children and their families."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ldp
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to the LDP Fund, we currently support 3 LDP students, Alfredo and\n"
"            Hellen from Ecuador and Tamirat from Ethiopia. The Leadership Development Program allows gifted young\n"
"            Christian people who have arrived at the end of their sponsorship to go to University and be trained\n"
"            as Christian leaders. In the coming years, these young people will be able to positively influence\n"
"            their nation for God.\n"
"            Through your donation you are offering these students a chance for a promising future and we are very\n"
"            grateful to you for your support.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to the LDP Fund, we currently support 3 LDP students, Alfredo and\n"
"            Hellen from Ecuador and Tamirat from Ethiopia. The Leadership Development Program allows gifted young\n"
"            Christian people who have arrived at the end of their sponsorship to go to University and be trained\n"
"            as Christian leaders. In the coming years, these young people will be able to positively influence\n"
"            their nation for God.\n"
"            Through your donation you are offering these students a chance for a promising future and we are very\n"
"            grateful to you for your support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_haf
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to water filters and rehydratation kits, the families of\n"
"            sponsored children can face this severe epidemic efficiently.\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your contribution to this action and for the help you\n"
"            therefore give the children and their families.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_anl
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation to Compassion Suisse we can continue to make\n"
"            our work known in Switzerland and to improve our services to sponsors, donors and sponsorchildren.\n"
"            We can offer a more efficient help to many needy children through sponsorships and complementary\n"
"            interventions in the countries supported by Compassion.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation to Compassion Suisse we can continue to make\n"
"            our work known in Switzerland and to improve our services to sponsors, donors and sponsorchildren.\n"
"            We can offer a more efficient help to many needy children through sponsorships and complementary\n"
"            interventions in the countries supported by Compassion."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_don
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation to Compassion Suisse we can continue to make our\n"
"            work known in Switzerland and to improve our services to sponsors, donors and sponsored children.\n"
"            We can offer a more efficient help to many needy children through sponsorships and complementary\n"
"            interventions in the countries supported by Compassion.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_urg
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation to the humanitarian emergency fund,\n"
"            you make it possible for the Compassion staff to bring the needed help immediately to\n"
"            the families of sponsored children who are touched by a natural disaster, famine or\n"
"            any other tragedy.\n"
"            Food, covers, shelters and replacement of certains belongings are commonly covered by this fund.\n"
"\n"
"            Your support is essential and brings new hope to the families of sponsorchildren, the staff\n"
"            of Compassion and the partner churches.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation to the humanitarian emergency fund, \n"
"tttyou make it possible for the Compassion staff to bring the needed help immediately to \n"
"tttthe families of sponsored children who are touched by a natural disaster, famine or \n"
"tttany other tragedy.\n"
"tttFood, covers, shelters and replacement of certains belongings are commonly covered by this fund.\n"
"\n"
"tttYour support is essential and brings new hope to the families of sponsorchildren, the staff \n"
"tttof Compassion and the partner churches."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_med
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation to the medical fund we can offer each\n"
"            sponsored child affected by a serious illness the necessary medical care and that way\n"
"            restore both health and hope. Apart from this we can also finance complementary interventions\n"
"            such as a vaccination campaign for several Compassion centers, distribution of mosquito nets\n"
"            to families that are registered in the Compassion program.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation to the medical fund we can offer each\n"
"            sponsored child affected by a serious illness the necessary medical care and that way\n"
"            restore both health and hope. Apart from this we can also finance complementary interventions\n"
"            such as a vaccination campaign for several Compassion centers, distribution of mosquito nets\n"
"            to families that are registered in the Compassion program."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_mag
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation you have subscribed to our magazine and you\n"
"            help us to cover the publishing costs. Our magazine is an important communication tool and\n"
"            allows us to make our work known and to sensibilise many people to the cause of poor children.\n"
"            We are very grateful for your precious support.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation you have subscribed to our magazine and you\n"
"            help us to cover the publishing costs. Our magazine is an important communication tool and\n"
"            allows us to make our work known and to sensibilise many people to the cause of poor children.\n"
"            We are very grateful for your precious support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_bib
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation you support the Bible Fund, by which we can\n"
"            offer a Bible to each child registered in a Compassion center. The holistic development of the\n"
"            child is one of the principal values of Compassion.\n"
"            Your support helps the child to grow spiritually, to strengthen his faith and to receive a\n"
"            precious encouragement.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation you support the Bible Fund, by which we can\n"
"            offer a Bible to each child registered in a Compassion center. The holistic development of the\n"
"            child is one of the principal values of Compassion.\n"
"            Your support helps the child to grow spiritually, to strengthen his faith and to receive a\n"
"            precious encouragement."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_ind
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the recent cyclone Aila in\n"
"            India and Bangladesh can receive a precious help. Compassion has already started to bring support and\n"
"            food to the affected families and will start to work at the rebuilding of damaged or destroyed centers\n"
"            or houses as soon as possible.\n"
"            Your support is essential and brings new hope to the families of sponsored children, the staff of\n"
"            Compassion and the partner churches.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_hai
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the terrible earthquake in\n"
"            Haiti can receive a precious help. Compassion is currently bringing support and food to the affected\n"
"            families and giving them all the necessary support. The emergency fund will also enable Compassion to\n"
"            rebuild damaged or destroyed centers by the disaster.\n"
"            Your support is essential and represents a clear sign of hope to the sponsored children, their\n"
"            families, the staff of Compassion and the partner churches in Haiti.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the terrible earthquake in\n"
"            Haiti can receive a precious help. Compassion is currently bringing support and food to the affected\n"
"            families and giving them all the necessary support. The emergency fund will also enable Compassion to\n"
"            rebuild damaged or destroyed centers by the disaster.\n"
"            Your support is essential and represents a clear sign of hope to the sponsored children, their\n"
"            families, the staff of Compassion and the partner churches in Haiti."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_phi
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, the families touched by the typhoon in\n"
"            the Philippines can receive a precious help. Compassion Philippines continues to distribute\n"
"            food as well as first aid material and bring the necessary support to all who have been affected\n"
"            by the floods.\n"
"\n"
"            Your support is essential and brings new hope to the families of sponsored children, the staff\n"
"            of Compassion and the partner churches.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_bfa
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, the sponsored children and their families\n"
"            touched by the recent floods in Burkina Faso can receive a precious help. Compassion Burkina\n"
"            Faso has already started to bring support and food to the affected families and will start to\n"
"            work at the rebuilding of damaged or destroyed centers or houses as soon as possible.\n"
"            Your support is essential and is a real sign of hope for the sponsored children, their families,\n"
"            the staff of Compassion and the partner churches.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_fam
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, the sponsored children and their families touched\n"
"            by famine receive a precious help. Compassion distributes food to the affected families but also\n"
"            provides formation and tools that help families to combat hunger on a long term basis.\n"
"            We thank you so much for your generosity and for your interest towards the poorest children and their\n"
"            families and for the hope that you give them through your support.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation, the sponsored children and their families touched\n"
"            by famine receive a precious help. Compassion distributes food to the affected families but also\n"
"            provides formation and tools that help families to combat hunger on a long term basis.\n"
"            We thank you so much for your generosity and for your interest towards the poorest children and their\n"
"            families and for the hope that you give them through your support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_cal
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation, you help us to finance our calendar which\n"
"            is a precious communication tool to make our work known in many households during the year.\n"
"            We also can offer a concrete help and a new future to many children on the field and restore\n"
"            hope in their lives.\n"
"\n"
"            We thank you very much for your support.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation, you help us to finance our calendar which \n"
"tttis a precious communication tool to make our work known in many households during the year. \n"
"tttWe also can offer a concrete help and a new future to many children on the field and restore \n"
"ttthope in their lives.\n"
"\n"
"tttWe thank you very much for your support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_wol
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water filters\n"
"            to provide sponsored children, their families, their community and villages with drinking\n"
"            water, in the poorest regions of the world.\n"
"            This help would not be possible without you and we are very grateful for your support.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your donation. It allows us to finance water filters\n"
"            to provide sponsored children, their families, their community and villages with drinking\n"
"            water, in the poorest regions of the world.\n"
"            This help would not be possible without you and we are very grateful for your support."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_kdo
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Thanks to your gift that will be entirely allocated to them, the family of\n"
"            your sponsored child will receive a precious additional help to cover their special needs and to\n"
"            improve their living conditions.\n"
"            We are very grateful for your complementary support to your sponsored child and his family that\n"
"            brings more hope and great encouragement to them.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Thanks to your gift that will be entirely allocated to them, the family of\n"
"            your sponsored child will receive a precious additional help to cover their special needs and to\n"
"            improve their living conditions.\n"
"            We are very grateful for your complementary support to your sponsored child and his family that\n"
"            brings more hope and great encouragement to them."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_pro
msgid ""
"\n"
"            The professional fund allows many young sponsored people to receive\n"
"            a professional training before they finish the sponsorship program.\n"
"            Thanks to your support we can continue to offer this service on a long-term basis and we are\n"
"            very grateful to you for your help.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"The professional fund allows many young sponsored people to receive\n"
"            a professional training before they finish the sponsorship program.\n"
"            Thanks to your support we can continue to offer this service on a long-term basis and we are\n"
"            very grateful to you for your help."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c20
msgid ""
"\n"
"            With your donation, you support the CSP (child survival program) in\n"
"            Ecuador. The center welcomes around 30 mothers and their babies and pregnant women. These women\n"
"            receive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on a regular basis and Bible lessons.\n"
"\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their babies and for the hope you\n"
"            are bringing to them through your help.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"With your donation, you support the CSP (child survival program) in \n"
"tttEcuador. The center welcomes around 30 mothers and their babies and pregnant women. These women \n"
"tttreceive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on a regular basis and Bible lessons.\n"
"\n"
"tttWe are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their babies and for the hope you \n"
"tttare bringing to them through your help."

#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c13
#: model:product.template,description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_c46
msgid ""
"\n"
"            With your donation, you support the CSP (child survival program) in\n"
"            Haiti. The center welcomes around 30 mothers and their babies and pregnant women. These women\n"
"            receive training, practical assistance, food, thorough medical checks on a regular basis and Bible lessons.\n"
"\n"
"            We are very grateful to you for your interest towards mothers and their babies and for the hope you\n"
